# Prometheus metrics — API.md §Health & telemetry
#
# Text exposition format, not JSON. Public by default; `[api] metrics_public`
# (runtime-mutable, see settings.http) moves it behind the API key.

@base = {{host}}

### Full scrape. Content-Type must be
### `text/plain; version=0.0.4; charset=utf-8` or Prometheus will not parse it.
GET {{base}}/metrics

### With a key — always accepted, whether or not it is required.
GET {{base}}/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

# Metrics worth eyeballing after a deploy (grep the response):
#
#   fastadhunter_ruleset_rules            compiled rule count — the number that
#                                         silently dropped to 55866 when list
#                                         registrations were not persisting
#   fastadhunter_ruleset_heap_bytes       compiled ruleset size (budget 40 MB)
#   process_resident_memory_bytes         RSS (budget 128 MB on the RB5009)
#   fastadhunter_queries_total{verdict}   per-verdict counters
#   fastadhunter_upstream_attempts_total  upstream health
